##### FinWave  
*solo* 

A 40 L oval mini-RAS morphs from gentle pond to swift river via programmable jets. Moving-bed bio-media keep ammonia low, a BSF-larvae feeder supplies live protein, and a plate chiller supports cold-water trout.

###### Crop Categories & Cultivars  
Edible fish – all 10 Balcony lines  

